st and found it had been created. I did not open a second one. Its summary covers the failure, the rollback, the partial failure, and the follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: investigate the v2.3.1 failure before trying that release again, and look into the orchestrator partial failure during rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}